      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Disagree at all, unlit will be overexposured in dark rooms. Standart or Diffuse shader is most physically correct one and looks very natural. If it's looks ugly it's mostly because world creater didn't use lightprobes or didn't setup abmbient light, so only direct lights are recived by mesh and opposite side of mesh is black in this cases.\n\nCorrect solution can be replacement hints: https://vrchat.canny.io/trust-and-safety-system/p/632-ability-for-creators-to-make-hints-for-shader-replacement",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
